376
00:17:47,870 --> 00:17:49,770
Good thing I drew this up.

377
00:17:49,970 --> 00:17:50,910
What's that?

378
00:17:50,910 --> 00:17:54,840
I present to you the relationship agreement.

379
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:01,280
A binding covenant that, in its 31 pages,

380
00:18:01,290 --> 00:18:03,450
enumerates, iterates and codifies

381
00:18:03,450 --> 00:18:06,420
the rights and responsibilities of Sheldon Lee Cooper,

382
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:08,420
here and after known as "the boyfriend,"

383
00:18:08,430 --> 00:18:10,260
and Amy Farrah Fowler,

384
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:13,260
here and after known as "the girlfriend""

385
00:18:15,570 --> 00:18:18,930
It's so romantic.

386
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:20,840
Mutual indemnification always is.

387
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:28,310
Why don't you start perusing while I set up my notary stamp.

388
00:18:30,110 --> 00:18:32,150
"Section 5: Hand-holding.

389
00:18:32,150 --> 00:18:33,550
"Hand-holding is only allowed

390
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,220
under the following circumstances.

391
00:18:35,220 --> 00:18:37,920
"A: Either party is in danger of falling off a cliff,

392
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:39,720
precipice or ledge;

393
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:42,260
B: Either party is deserving of a hearty handshake

394
00:18:42,260 --> 00:18:44,830
