395
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:47,900
C: Moral support during flu shots"

396
00:18:51,070 --> 00:18:52,500
Seems a bit restrictive.

397
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:54,900
Feel free to retain a lawyer.

398
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:06,480
Penny, I said "right hand red."

399
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,610
Yeah, I heard you.

400
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:09,680
I got red.

401
00:19:10,790 --> 00:19:15,060
Bernadette, left foot yellow.

402
00:19:16,530 --> 00:19:18,660
We should play limbo next.

403
00:19:18,660 --> 00:19:21,190
No one beats me at limbo.

404
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:25,570
Penny. Amy. Bernadette.

405
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:29,100
That's my boyfriend.

406
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:30,470
It's open!

407
00:19:31,870 --> 00:19:33,070
I got a splinter.

408
00:19:34,580 --> 00:19:36,080
What do you want me to do about it?

409
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:39,180
Relationship agreement Section 4: Boo-boos and Ouchies.

410
00:19:39,180 --> 00:19:40,880
You have to take care of it.

411
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:43,250
