412
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:48,860
Looks like it's just us playing.

413
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:57,230
Penny?

414
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:00,870
Penny, we're out of wine!

415
00:20:00,870 --> 00:20:02,670
You should probably drive.

